      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "vs VMs: one pod per service with real requests/limits + HPA; Service DNS + NetworkPolicy replace hand-maintained cross-box security groups; Ingress + cert-manager replace Caddy; a single oauth2-proxy replaces one-per-dashboard; kubectl replaces Portainer + agents. Caveat: HCM03-1C is the only enabled AZ → no cross-AZ HA; VKS force-upgrades clusters after a K8s version’s end-of-support (target 1.30 / 1.31).",
      "originalText": "vs VMs: one pod per service with real requests/limits + HPA; Service DNS + NetworkPolicy replace hand-maintained cross-box security groups; Ingress + cert-manager replace Caddy; a single oauth2-proxy replaces one-per-dashboard; kubectl replaces Portainer + agents. Caveat: HCM03-1C is the only enabled AZ → no cross-AZ HA; VKS force-upgrades clusters after a K8s version’s end-of-support (target 1.30 / 1.31).",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
