      "text": "NGINX Ingress Controller + cert-manager (Let’s Encrypt TLS) — L7 path routing\n/ → frontend   /c360api → api   /auth → keycloak   /ads → ads   /data → tracking   /jaeger · /netdata · /pgadmin → oauth2 (SSO)",
